<% layout("layouts/boilerplate") %>

<main class="info-page">
    <section class="info-hero">
        <span class="info-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i></span>
        <p class="info-eyebrow">Your trust matters</p>
        <h1>Privacy at WonderLust</h1>
        <p>We collect and use information responsibly so you can discover stays with confidence.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="info-card">
        <h2>What we collect</h2>
        <p>When you create an account, list a property, make a booking, or contact us, we may collect details such as your name, email address, listing information, and booking preferences.</p>

        <h2>How we use your information</h2>
        <p>We use this information to provide and improve WonderLust, process bookings, keep accounts secure, personalize your experience, and communicate important updates about the service.</p>

        <h2>Information sharing</h2>
        <p>We only share information when it is needed to provide the service, comply with the law, protect our users, or operate trusted infrastructure. We do not sell your personal information.</p>

        <h2>Your choices</h2>
        <p>You can review your account information, manage your listings and bookings, or contact us with questions about your data. We may update this policy as WonderLust grows.</p>
    </section>
</main>
